# Both Dockerfiles build from the repo root, so keep the context small and make
# sure host artifacts never shadow what `bun install` produces in the image.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
docs
# The public config docs page is built from the reference itself.
!docs/CONFIG.md

.env
**/.env
!**/.env.example

playwright-report
test-results
coverage
